OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Time for Ukraine to get new
OL,4,Apresident,' says Trump after Zelensky
OL,5,Acondemns diesel deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to the media as he left the
OL,8,FWhite House on Saturday, Trump said the
OL,9,FUkrainian president "wants to make
OL,10,Fproblems for the world" by continuing
OL,11,Fto authorise attacks on Russian
OL,12,Frefineries.
OL,14,F"He'd better damn well stop," Trump
OL,15,Fsaid before suggesting Ukraine should
OL,16,F"get a new leader who can make a deal".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
